) -> torch.Tensor:
    r"""This function creates a mask tensor from a mod_fn function.

    Args:
        mod_fn (Union[_score_mod_signature, _mask_mod_signature]): Function to modify attention scores.
        B (int): Batch size.
        H (int): Number of query heads.
